1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,447
Stop cleaning your wood cabinets with a
dripping wet cloth.

2
00:00:03,633 --> 00:00:06,117
Too much water on wood can swell, warp

3
00:00:06,211 --> 00:00:07,731
or stain the surface.

4
00:00:07,933 --> 00:00:10,536
Wring the cloth out well, so it's damp

5
00:00:10,546 --> 00:00:13,612
but not dripping, then immediately dry the
cabinets

6
00:00:13,622 --> 00:00:15,839
with a dry microfiber cloth.

7
00:00:16,033 --> 00:00:18,784
The full seven-step guide is on the
channel.
